\begin{prop}
\ollabel{prop:free-for}
The relation $\fn{FreeFor}(x, y, z)$, which holds iff the term with
G\"odel number~$y$ is !!{free for} the variable with G\"odel
number~$z$ in the formula with G\"odel number~$x$, is primitive
recursive.
